WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.225
MP Voting Records — How They Voted.

00:00:03.175 --> 00:00:07.775
Every Member of Parliament swore an oath to serve the people of Canada.

00:00:07.775 --> 00:00:10.550
Here is exactly how they used it.

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.450
Hansard division records are permanent, public, and beyond deletion.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.087
They voted.

00:00:17.087 --> 00:00:19.175
We documented it.

00:00:19.175 --> 00:00:20.875
You decide.
